<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25402" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαν-οίγω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lay open,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ὀφθαλμούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ly.</u>
					210a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήτραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
					2.23
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
				3.5
			</span></i>,al., <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.86
			</span></i>; of a dead body, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				507a21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>open so as to connect,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν Ἰνδικὸν καὶ Περσικὸν κόλπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Mu.</u>
					393b3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>reveal, explain,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς γραφάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
					24.32
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				17.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τῶν παλαιῶν ἀπόρρητα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aen.Gaz.
					<u>Thphr.</u>
					p.5B.
				</span></i>
			</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
